DESCRIPTION >
    Analytics: raw pageview rows over a date range with optional drill-down
    filters, feeding the /analytics/browsers route's JS-side browser-share
    grouping (dedup by anonymous_id per browser). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/lib/posthog.js:129-146 (`fetchPageviews`, shared by 5 call sites) as
    called from api/routes/analytics.js:804 (queryName 'browsers', limit
    50000). Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp).

    IDENTITY CORRECTION (verified against the actual source, contradicting
    the dispatch's rule #19b assumption for this row): fetchPageviews'
    PAGEVIEW_FIELDS table (posthog.js:75-88) maps its output column
    `anonymous_id` to the RAW `distinct_id` column, not to properties.
    anonymous_id — confirmed verbatim: `['anonymous_id', 'distinct_id']`.
    That is genuinely true only of live.js:22 (a different query). Ported
    as the typed distinct_id column — the canonical stitching key, not a
    JSON-bag read, no cost concern.

    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): same as summary.pipe —
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type, properties.page_url
    -> page_url, properties.referrer -> referrer, properties.utm_source ->
    utm_source, properties.utm_medium -> utm_medium, properties.utm_campaign
    -> utm_campaign, properties.country -> country, properties.device_type
    -> device_type, properties.browser_name -> browser_name, properties.
    ai_source -> ai_source (all Nullable per §2.6).
    JSON-BAG FIELD HIT: properties.os_name -> os_name is bag-only per §2.6 —
    read via JSONExtractString(properties, 'os_name').

    OPTIONAL DRILL-DOWN FILTERS: identical mechanism to summary.pipe — see
    its DESCRIPTION for the full 9-type filter mapping and the documented
    single-filter-per-type simplification.

    SHARED TEMPLATE — structurally IDENTICAL to summary.pipe, sources_ai.
    pipe, sources_ref.pipe, and os.pipe (same fetchPageviews call, differing
    only in caller default LIMIT and runtime filter values) — same
    cross-file-duplicate relationship as alert_*/integ_* from earlier
    batches; authored separately per the dispatch ("one .pipe each"),
    flagged as a Phase-6 consolidation candidate.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.
    DEPLOY FIX (tb --cloud deploy --check, ST_Staging v4.6.4): date/datetime
    params were declared String(param, required=True) then wrapped in
    toDateTime(...) — that combination failed with CANNOT_PARSE_DATETIME
    under --check's '__no_value__' placeholder injection (a non-date string
    toDateTime() can't parse). Fixed by declaring the param itself as
    DateTime(...) (matching the already-shipped Phase 4 pipes' proven
    pattern) and dropping the now-redundant toDateTime(...) wrapper — no
    SQL/filter logic changed, only the param type. Re-validated via
    tb --cloud sql with real values post-fix; parity held (see batch
    dispatch report).

NODE browsers_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        page_url AS url,
        referrer,
        utm_source,
        utm_medium,
        utm_campaign,
        country,
        device_type AS device,
        browser_name AS browser,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'os_name') AS os,
        ai_source,
        distinct_id AS anonymous_id,
        timestamp
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from_ts, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to_ts, required=True) }}
      {% if defined(filter_page) %}
      AND arrayExists(x -> page_url ILIKE concat('%', x, '%'), splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_page, required=True) }}))
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_entry) %}
      AND arrayExists(x -> page_url ILIKE concat('%', x, '%'), splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_entry, required=True) }}))
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_exit) %}
      AND arrayExists(x -> page_url ILIKE concat('%', x, '%'), splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_exit, required=True) }}))
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_source) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_source, required=True) }}), referrer)
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_country) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_country, required=True) }}), country)
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_device) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_device, required=True) }}), device_type)
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_browser) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_browser, required=True) }}), browser_name)
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_os) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_os, required=True) }}), JSONExtractString(properties, 'os_name'))
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_ai_source) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_ai_source, required=True) }}), ai_source)
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(filter_channel) %}
      AND has(splitByChar(',', {{ String(filter_channel, required=True) }}),
        multiIf(
          ai_source IS NOT NULL AND ai_source != '', 'AI Search',
          (gclid IS NOT NULL AND gclid != '') OR (gbraid IS NOT NULL AND gbraid != '') OR (wbraid IS NOT NULL AND wbraid != '') OR (msclkid IS NOT NULL AND msclkid != ''), 'Paid Search',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('cpc','ppc','paid','paid_search','paidsearch','sem'), 'Paid Search',
          (fbclid IS NOT NULL AND fbclid != '') OR (ttclid IS NOT NULL AND ttclid != '') OR (li_fat_id IS NOT NULL AND li_fat_id != '') OR (li_fatid IS NOT NULL AND li_fatid != '') OR (twclid IS NOT NULL AND twclid != '') OR (snapclid IS NOT NULL AND snapclid != '') OR (pclid IS NOT NULL AND pclid != '') OR (sccid IS NOT NULL AND sccid != ''), 'Paid Social',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('paid_social','paidsocial','social_paid'), 'Paid Social',
          dclid IS NOT NULL AND dclid != '', 'Display',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('display','banner','gdn','expandable','retargeting'), 'Display',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('affiliate','affiliates','partner','cpa','cps'), 'Affiliate',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('email','e-mail','newsletter','mailing','edm'), 'Email',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) IN ('sms','text','mms'), 'SMS',
          arrayExists(h -> position(if(referrer IS NOT NULL AND referrer != '' AND domain(referrer) = domain(page_url), '', lower(COALESCE(referrer, ''))), h) > 0, ['google.','bing.','yahoo.','duckduckgo.','ecosia.','kagi.','brave.','yandex.','baidu.']), 'Organic Search',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_source, ''))) IN ('google','bing','yahoo','duckduckgo','baidu','yandex','brave','ecosia') AND lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) = '', 'Organic Search',
          arrayExists(h -> position(if(referrer IS NOT NULL AND referrer != '' AND domain(referrer) = domain(page_url), '', lower(COALESCE(referrer, ''))), h) > 0, ['facebook.com','instagram.com','linkedin.com','twitter.com','x.com','tiktok.com','pinterest.com','reddit.com','youtube.com','snapchat.com','threads.net']), 'Organic Social',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_source, ''))) IN ('facebook','instagram','linkedin','twitter','x','tiktok','pinterest','reddit','youtube','snapchat') AND lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_medium, ''))) = '', 'Organic Social',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_source, ''))) IN ('mailchimp','klaviyo','hubspot','sendgrid','customer.io','brevo','activecampaign','drip','omnisend','postmark','mailerlite'), 'Email',
          length(if(referrer IS NOT NULL AND referrer != '' AND domain(referrer) = domain(page_url), '', lower(COALESCE(referrer, '')))) > 5, 'Referral',
          lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_source, ''))) = '' OR lower(trim(COALESCE(utm_source, ''))) = 'direct', 'Direct',
          'Other Campaign'
        )
      )
      {% end %}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT {{ Int32(limit_val, 50000) }}

TYPE endpoint
